#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/v2.rst:2
msgid "Configuration file reference"
msgstr "配置文件参考"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/v2.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports configuring your documentation builds with a "
"configuration file. This file is named ``.readthedocs.yaml`` and should be "
"placed in the top level of your Git repository."
msgstr "Read the Docs 支持使用配置文件来配置文档构建。该文件名为 ``.readthedocs.yaml``，应放在 Git 仓库的顶层目录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/v2.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``.readthedocs.yaml``  file can contain a number of settings that are "
"not accessible through the Read the Docs website."
msgstr "``.readthedocs.yaml`` 文件可以包含许多通过 Read the Docs 网站界面无法访问的设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/v2.rst:11
msgid ""
"When using a monorepo, it is possible to place the ``.readthedocs.yaml`` "
"file in a subdirectory and configure a custom path from the project settings"
" dashboard. All paths in the configuration file are always relative to the "
"**repository root**, not the location of the configuration file. See the "
":doc:`/guides/setup/monorepo` documentation for more details."
msgstr ""
"使用 monorepo 时，可以将 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` "
"文件放在子目录中，并从项目设置仪表盘配置自定义路径。配置文件中的所有路径始终相对于**仓库根目录**，而非配置文件的位置。详情请参阅 "
":doc:`/guides/setup/monorepo` 文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/v2.rst:18
msgid ""
"Because the file is stored in Git, the configuration will apply to the exact"
" version that is being built. **This allows you to store different "
"configurations for different versions of your documentation.**"
msgstr "因为文件存储在 Git 中，配置将应用于正在构建的特定版本。**这允许你为文档的不同版本存储不同的配置。**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/config-file/v2.rst:22
